THE DEMO LIBRARY IS NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE

The MIT grant covers this project's own source, documentation and assets. It
does not cover the books, music, artwork and video under `demo-data/`, which
are other people's work, included so the app can be tried without a library of
your own. Each is credited with its own licence in
demo-data/demo-library/README.md.

If you are reusing this project, the safe move is to delete `demo-data/` and
point the app at your own folder. Nothing in the application depends on it.
